msgstr "`GitHub Release <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/releases/tag/v5.1.1>`__"

msgid "本页归档发布时的完整说明，仅转换文档格式并将旧相对链接固定到对应标签。 文中的路径、功能范围、验证结果与已知限制均指该历史版本，不代表当前版本状态或重新验收。"
msgstr ""
"This page archives the complete release notes, changing only the document format and anchoring old"
" relative links to the corresponding tag. Paths, features, validation results, and known "
"limitations refer to that historical version, not current status or renewed acceptance testing."

msgid "发布范围"
msgstr "Release scope"

msgid ""
"上一版本基线：``5.1.0`` 的版本提交 `372641705ae46f7523d26fef0e4e200212842c78 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/commit/372641705ae46f7523d26fef0e4e200212842c78>`__。"
msgstr ""
"Previous baseline: version commit `372641705ae46f7523d26fef0e4e200212842c78 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/commit/372641705ae46f7523d26fef0e4e200212842c78>`__ "
"for ``5.1.0``."

msgid ""
"本次版本：``5.1.1``，终点为 `v5.1.1 <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/tree/v5.1.1>`__ "
"指向的本次版本提交；完整提交身份以该标签为准。"
msgstr ""
"Current version: ``5.1.1``, ending at the version commit referenced by `v5.1.1 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/tree/v5.1.1>`__; that tag defines the complete commit"
" identity."

msgid ""
"更新区间为 ``(上一版本提交, 本次版本提交]``，起点不含、终点包含。仅总结主仓自身应用、系统配置、构建、测试与文档的有效变化；不重复 ReliefNT 实现或纯 gitlink "
"更新，合并提交不单列。"
msgstr ""
"The update range is ``(上一版本提交, 本次版本提交]``, excluding the start and including the end. Only "
"effective changes to this repository's applications, system configuration, builds, tests, and "
"documentation are summarized. ReliefNT implementations and gitlink-only updates are not repeated, "
"and merge commits are not listed separately."

msgid "本次是正式源码 Release，提供标签、中文说明及 GitHub 自动源码归档，不附二进制镜像、SDK 或内核文件。"
msgstr ""
"This is a stable source release with a tag, Chinese notes, and GitHub's automatic source archives,"
" without binary images, SDK, or kernel files."

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid "办公、数学与任务管理"
msgstr "Office, mathematics, and task management"

msgid ""
"新增 **ReliefMath** 离线公式编辑器：一个 ``.rmath`` 文档管理多条 LaTeX 公式，提供源码高亮、括号匹配、补全、参数占位跳转、131 "
"项插入目录，以及分数、根式、上下标、积分、矩阵、分段和对齐等工具与向导。支持公式排序、筛选、样式、模板、收藏、撤销重做及错误定位。"
msgstr ""
"Added **ReliefMath**, an offline formula editor. One ``.rmath`` document manages multiple LaTeX "
"formulas, with syntax highlighting, bracket matching, completion, argument-placeholder navigation,"
" 131 insertion entries, and tools/wizards for fractions, radicals, scripts, integrals, matrices, "
"piecewise expressions, and alignment. Includes formula sorting/filtering, styles, templates, "
"favorites, undo/redo, and error location."

msgid ""
"ReliefMath 通过独立渲染进程显示预览，支持 SVG、透明 PNG、LaTeX 源码及批量导出；SVG 字形转为轮廓。后台文档读写包含原子保存、外部修改检测和恢复快照，接入锁定的 "
"Cairo/FreeType 开发依赖及 STIX Two Math 字体和许可文件。渲染仅支持明确列出的数学子集，不提供完整 TeX 宏包环境。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefMath previews through a separate rendering process and supports SVG, transparent PNG, LaTeX "
"source, and batch export; SVG glyphs become outlines. Background document I/O includes atomic "
"saves, external-change detection, and recovery snapshots. Pinned Cairo/FreeType development "
"dependencies and STIX Two Math fonts/licenses are integrated. Rendering supports only the "
"documented mathematical subset, not a full TeX package environment."

msgid ""
"新增 **ReliefTodo** 离线任务管理器：支持标题、备注、项目、标签、优先级、截止日期和完成状态，提供日期/项目/文本筛选、排序、多选、批量处理、统计和撤销重做。使用 "
"``.rtodo`` 原生文档，支持 CSV、Markdown 导出；文件工作进程处理冲突检测、保存锁、同步及原子替换。"
msgstr ""
"Added **ReliefTodo**, an offline task manager supporting titles, notes, projects, tags, "
"priorities, due dates, and completion state, with date/project/text filtering, sorting, "
"multiselection, batch actions, statistics, and undo/redo. Uses native ``.rtodo`` documents and "
"CSV/Markdown export; file workers handle conflict detection, save locks, synchronization, and "
"atomic replacement."

msgid ""
"新增 **ReliefMath++** 几何与函数工作区：支持二维显函数、隐式曲线、极坐标与参数曲线，三维显函数、参数曲面与空间曲线，以及点、线段、向量、圆、椭圆、平面、球、长方体等共 23 "
"种对象。提供四个参数滑块、二维平移和三维旋转缩放、对象属性编辑、撤销重做与示例。"
msgstr ""
"Added **ReliefMath++**, a geometry/function workspace supporting 2D explicit functions, implicit, "
"polar, and parametric curves, 3D explicit functions, parametric surfaces and spatial curves, and "
"23 object types including points, segments, vectors, circles, ellipses, planes, spheres, and "
"cuboids. Provides four parameter sliders, 2D panning, 3D rotation/zoom, property editing, "
"undo/redo, and examples."

msgid ""
"ReliefMath++ 提供函数值、导数、积分、夹根、交点、极值、切线、曲面梯度/法向量、切平面、二重积分、曲面面积和几何/向量计算，支持 ``.rmathpp`` 文档、SVG/PNG 及值表"
" CSV。三维采用软件正交投影；计算使用数值方法，不是符号代数系统，也不要求 GPU 加速。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefMath++ offers function values, derivatives, integrals, root bracketing, intersections, "
"extrema, tangents, surface gradients/normals, tangent planes, double integrals, surface areas, and"
" geometry/vector calculations. Supports ``.rmathpp``, SVG/PNG, and value-table CSV. 3D uses "
"software orthographic projection; calculations are numerical, not symbolic algebra, and require no"
" GPU acceleration."

msgid ""
"将已有 **ReliefMail** 邮件客户端实现接入主仓 FLTK 构建、默认组件及镜像，提供标准 desktop 启动入口，并加入 Office 分组。上一版仅交付其开发源码；本区间交付的是"
" SMTP/IMAP、多账户、邮件编辑与保险库等已有实现的默认系统集成。"
msgstr ""
"Integrated the existing **ReliefMail** implementation into this repository's FLTK build, default "
"components, and images, with a standard desktop launcher in the Office group. The previous release"
" supplied development sources only; this range delivers default-system integration of existing "
"SMTP/IMAP, multiaccount, composition, and vault functionality."

msgid ""
"三个新应用均接入默认菜单、独立图标、中文翻译、desktop/MIME 声明及原生文件打开关联。文件管理器增加 ``.rmath``、``.rtodo``、``.rmathpp`` "
"默认打开程序，同时保留用户自定义关联的优先级。"
msgstr ""
"All three new applications have default-menu entries, independent icons, Chinese translations, "
"desktop/MIME declarations, and native-file associations. Fileman adds default openers for "
"``.rmath``, ``.rtodo``, and ``.rmathpp``, preserving user-association precedence."

msgid ""
"Excel、Word、PPT 的“文件”按钮恢复 FLTK gtk+ 默认盒型；Office 顶栏统一使用“文件”，清理 ``F`` 助记标识及旧翻译，涵盖 Mail 主窗口和写信窗口。"
msgstr ""
"Excel, Word, and PPT File buttons restore FLTK gtk+ default box styling. Office top bars "
"consistently use File, removing the ``F`` mnemonic and old translations, including Mail's main and"
" composition windows."

msgid "图形桌面、账户与安装器"
msgstr "Graphical desktop, accounts, and installer"

msgid ""
"补入锁定的 Mesa Gallium DRI 子包，让桌面可使用上游 ``vmwgfx`` 入口；Xorg 从固定 fbdev 配置转为标准自动探测，在具备 DRM 能力时选择 "
"modesetting/glamor，在没有 DRM 节点时保留 fbdev 路线。默认使用软件光标并关闭 modesetting page flip；这不等于关闭 DRI3/Present。"
msgstr ""
"Added pinned Mesa Gallium DRI subpackages for the upstream ``vmwgfx`` entry point. Xorg moves from"
" fixed fbdev configuration to standard autodetection: modesetting/glamor with DRM support, fbdev "
"without DRM nodes. Software cursors are the default and modesetting page flips are disabled; "
"DRI3/Present are not thereby disabled."

msgid ""
"XDM 会话环境允许传递 ``RELIEFOS_XORG_EVENT_FD``；非 DRM 的 fbdev 启动包装器请求 32 位色深。更新 Xorg、SVGA3D "
"配置、软件回退及性能诊断文档。内核 DRM、SVGA3D 和信号实现见独立 ReliefNT Release。"
msgstr ""
"The XDM session environment may pass ``RELIEFOS_XORG_EVENT_FD``; the non-DRM fbdev startup wrapper"
" requests 32-bit depth. Updated Xorg, SVGA3D configuration, software-fallback, and performance-"
"diagnostic documentation. See the separate ReliefNT Release for kernel DRM, SVGA3D, and signal "
"implementation."

msgid ""
"默认账户资料增加 ``video`` 组（GID 44），安装账户及新建普通用户加入该组；统一账户名校验，拒绝 ``root``、``nobody``、``wheel``、``video`` "
"等保留名称，补充组成员和登录身份回归。"
msgstr ""
"Default account data adds ``video`` (GID 44), with installed accounts and new normal users joining"
" it. Unified account-name validation rejects reserved names such as ``root``, ``nobody``, "
"``wheel``, and ``video``; added membership/login-identity regressions."

msgid ""
"将 FLTK 应用清单集中到 ``configs/fltk-apps.list``，同时供应用构建和安装器控制台目标裁剪使用。关闭 Xorg 时，安装载荷按同一清单裁剪图形应用，避免新增应用遗漏。"
msgstr ""
"Centralized FLTK application lists in ``configs/fltk-apps.list`` for both builds and installer "
"console-target trimming. With Xorg disabled, installation payloads trim graphical applications "
"from the same list, avoiding omissions of new apps."

msgid "开发、构建与验证工具"
msgstr "Development, build, and validation tools"

msgid ""
"为 ReliefMath、Todo、Math++ 增加组件配置、包归属、构建/资源 staging、文档格式与工作流测试；补充独立 QEMU GUI 验收工具、磁盘结果核对和原始运行截图记录。"
msgstr ""
"Added component configuration, package ownership, build/resource staging, document-format, and "
"workflow tests for ReliefMath, Todo, and Math++; added independent QEMU GUI acceptance tools, "
"disk-result checks, and original runtime screenshots."

msgid ""
"主仓增加 DRM/execbuf/fence、fbdev、描述符与映射、用户异常、控制台恢复、调度和信号唤醒的用户态/宿主回归夹具，并同步 SDK "
"头文件导出清单。这些是主仓测试和集成更新，不作为内核实现重复列出。"
msgstr ""
"Added userspace/host regression fixtures for DRM/execbuf/fence, fbdev, descriptors/mappings, user "
"exceptions, console recovery, scheduling, and signal wakeup, and synchronized SDK header exports. "
"These are repository tests/integration updates, not repeated claims of kernel implementation."

msgid "内核版本回归脚本改为从版本配置读取字符串及数字字段，继续检查后缀、非法输入拒绝、无操作重建、父仓适配和 procfs，避免每次发布后留下旧版本断言。"
msgstr ""
"Kernel-version regressions now read strings/numeric fields from version configuration while "
"retaining suffix, invalid-input, no-op rebuild, parent-integration, and procfs checks, preventing "
"stale version assertions after releases."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking changes"

msgid "**是，主要涉及账户配置与交互工作流。**"
msgstr "**Yes, mainly account configuration and interactive workflows.**"

msgid ""
"``video`` 成为保留账户名和系统图形访问组；自定义账户库若已有同名账户、不同 GID 的 ``video`` 组，或 GID 44 被其他组占用，需要人工协调，不能直接覆盖账户文件。"
msgstr ""
"``video`` becomes a reserved account name and graphics-access system group. Custom account "
"databases with an existing video account, a different-GID ``video`` group, or GID 44 assigned "
"elsewhere require manual reconciliation; do not overwrite account files directly."

msgid "图形默认配置不再强制固定 fbdev。自定义 Xorg 配置、设备访问权限及只适配旧固定路径的启动脚本需重新核对；新增用户入组不会自动修订所有已有系统账户。"
msgstr ""
"Default graphics no longer force fixed fbdev. Recheck custom Xorg configuration, device "
"permissions, and startup scripts tied to the old fixed path; new-user group membership does not "
"automatically update all existing accounts."

msgid "顶栏移除 ``F`` 助记标签，依赖该标签自动提供的 ``Alt+F`` 入口的操作习惯或自动化脚本需调整；菜单项自己的 Ctrl 快捷键仍按各应用定义提供。"
msgstr ""
"The top-bar ``F`` mnemonic is removed. Workflows or automation relying on its automatically "
"supplied ``Alt+F`` entry need adjustment; menu-item Ctrl shortcuts remain application-defined."

msgid "新文档使用各自原生格式，不承诺与 Microsoft Office 文件或其他数学/任务管理软件的私有格式兼容。内核 API 的迁移影响请另读 ReliefNT 5.1.1 说明。"
msgstr ""
"New documents use native formats, without promised compatibility with Microsoft Office or other "
"mathematics/task-management private formats. Read ReliefNT 5.1.1 notes separately for kernel API "
"migration impacts."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and migration notes"

msgid "先备份文档、邮件资料与保险库、账户组文件及自定义 Xorg 配置。现有安装跨版本原地升级、早期 Mail 开发资料迁移及全部文件系统组合尚未完成整版验收，先在独立副本验证自己的路径。"
msgstr ""
"Back up documents, mail/vault data, account/group files, and custom Xorg settings first. Full-"
"release acceptance is incomplete for in-place upgrades, early Mail development-data migration, and"
" all filesystem combinations; validate your path in a separate copy first."

msgid ""
"从本标签递归初始化子模块，并使用该标签固定的 ReliefNT 提交；获取锁定依赖后重新构建。GitHub 自动源码归档不展开子模块，单独下载 ZIP/TAR.GZ 不能代替完整构建输入。"
msgstr ""
"Recursively initialize submodules from this tag using its pinned ReliefNT commit, fetch locked "
"dependencies, then rebuild. GitHub automatic archives do not expand submodules; ZIP/TAR.GZ "
"downloads alone are not complete build inputs."

msgid "合并 ``video`` 组配置并核对目标用户的补充组；已有会话需要重新登录才能重新取得组成员。保留用户个人配置，勿把示例账户文件直接覆盖到现有系统。"
msgstr ""
"Merge ``video`` group configuration and check target users' supplementary groups. Existing "
"sessions need a new login to acquire membership. Preserve user settings; do not overwrite live "
"systems with example account files."

msgid ""
"按需合并 ``/etc/X11/`` 下的 Xorg/XDM 配置；是否得到加速上下文须结合设备能力、Xorg/Mesa 日志和实际绘制核实。软件回退、GPU "
"查询值或单个示例成功均不代表整版硬件加速验收。"
msgstr ""
"Merge Xorg/XDM configuration under ``/etc/X11/`` as needed. Confirm acceleration contexts using "
"device capabilities, Xorg/Mesa logs, and actual rendering. Software fallback, reported GPU values,"
" or one successful example do not establish full hardware-acceleration acceptance."

msgid ""
"数学公式保存为 ``.rmath``，几何场景保存为 ``.rmathpp``，任务清单保存为 ``.rtodo``。导出的图像、CSV、Markdown、LaTeX "
"用于交换，不保留全部原生编辑状态。"
msgstr ""
"Save formulas as ``.rmath``, geometry scenes as ``.rmathpp``, and task lists as ``.rtodo``. "
"Exported images, CSV, Markdown, and LaTeX are exchange formats and do not preserve all native "
"editing state."

msgid ""
"Todo 不提供自动保存、崩溃恢复、云同步或后台提醒；请主动保存。Todo/Math++ 的共享保存锁对不遵守协议的外部写入者不提供事务隔离；FAT32 空文件锁识别及 FAT32/exFAT "
"运行验证仍有限制。"
msgstr ""
"Todo has no autosave, crash recovery, cloud synchronization, or background reminders; save "
"explicitly. Shared Todo/Math++ save locks provide no transaction isolation from noncooperating "
"external writers. FAT32 empty-file lock detection and FAT32/exFAT runtime validation remain "
"limited."

msgid "**ReliefMath 在最近的 QEMU 标签检查中关窗触发段错误，退出码 139，尚未修复且原因未定位。** 本次版本发布没有修改其关闭逻辑，不应将该应用视为完整运行验收通过。"
msgstr ""
"**In the latest QEMU label check, closing ReliefMath caused a segmentation fault, exit code 139; "
"it remains unfixed and undiagnosed.** This release does not change its close logic, and the "
"application must not be considered to have passed full runtime acceptance."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer notes"

msgid ""
"生产入口为根 GNU Make。数字基础版本为 ``5.1.1``；主仓与固定的内核分别生成对应版本头，内核数字字段为 ``5/1/1``，后缀继续通过 "
"``EXTRAVERSION``/``LOCALVERSION`` 配置。"
msgstr ""
"The production entry is root GNU Make. The numeric base version is ``5.1.1``; this repository and "
"the pinned kernel generate their own version headers. Kernel numeric fields are ``5/1/1``, with "
"suffixes still configured by ``EXTRAVERSION``/``LOCALVERSION``."

msgid ""
"本区间图形应用使用目标 musl、C++17、FLTK gtk+ 及中文字体；保持目标运行库边界。ReliefMath 还依赖锁定的 Cairo/FreeType "
"开发输入和随包数学字体，须通过现有构建链获取与装配。"
msgstr ""
"Graphical applications in this range use target musl, C++17, FLTK gtk+, and Chinese fonts, "
"preserving target-runtime boundaries. ReliefMath also requires pinned Cairo/FreeType development "
"inputs and packaged math fonts, fetched and assembled through the existing build pipeline."

msgid "新增图形应用时同步中央 FLTK 清单、组件、包归属、菜单、翻译及安装器控制台裁剪；新增公开头通过导出白名单供 SDK 消费。"
msgstr ""
"New graphical applications must update the central FLTK list, components, package ownership, "
"menus, translations, and installer console trimming together. New public headers reach the SDK "
"through the export allowlist."

msgid ""
"ReliefMath 支持范围见 `命令表 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/RELIEFMATH_COMMANDS.md>`__；数值绘图、采样边界及任务保存限制分别见"
" `ReliefMath++ "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/RELIEFMATHPP.md>`__、`ReliefTodo "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/RELIEFTODO.md>`__。"
msgstr ""
"For ReliefMath scope, see the `command table "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/RELIEFMATH_COMMANDS.md>`__; for "
"numerical plotting/sampling boundaries and task-save limitations, see `ReliefMath++ "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/RELIEFMATHPP.md>`__ and `ReliefTodo "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/RELIEFTODO.md>`__ respectively."

msgid ""
"后续版本继续遵循 `发布规范 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md>`__，从本次版本提交之后计算更新范围，两仓独立编写说明。"
msgstr ""
"Future versions continue following the `release policy "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md>`__, counting "
"changes after this version commit and documenting each repository independently."

msgid "验证与已知限制"
msgstr "Validation and known limitations"

msgid ""
"**源码检查：** 分别核对两仓 5.1.0 版本提交后的历史和最终差异；检查版本输入、系统身份、说明范围及提交文件。没有改写 ABI golden、音频 manifest 或任务外文件。"
msgstr ""
"**Source inspection:** independently checked both repositories' history/final diffs after their "
"5.1.0 version commits, version inputs, system identity, note scope, and committed files. ABI "
"golden data, audio manifests, and out-of-task files were not rewritten."

msgid ""
"**本次编译通过：** ``TMPDIR=\"$PWD/out/tmp\" make O=out/xorg-vmware-debug PROFILE=debug -j4 build-info "
"kernel test-tools``；生成的主仓/内核版本均为 ``5.1.1``、数字字段为 ``5/1/1``。宿主普通及 ASan/UBSan 工具测试通过。"
msgstr ""
"**Compilation passed this time:** ``TMPDIR=\"$PWD/out/tmp\" make O=out/xorg-vmware-debug "
"PROFILE=debug -j4 build-info kernel test-tools``. Generated repository/kernel versions are "
"``5.1.1``, numeric fields ``5/1/1``. Normal and ASan/UBSan host-tool tests passed."

msgid ""
"**本次定向检查通过：** ``test-version-abi.sh``、``test-kernel-version.sh``、``test-rpr-packages.sh``，均使用主仓 "
"``out/tmp``；覆盖版本身份、后缀/数字字段、无操作生成、父仓适配、procfs 与 RPR 包命名/信任规则。"
msgstr ""
"**Targeted checks passed this time:** ``test-version-abi.sh``, ``test-kernel-version.sh``, and "
"``test-rpr-packages.sh``, all using this repository's ``out/tmp``. They cover version identity, "
"suffixes/numeric fields, no-op generation, parent integration, procfs, and RPR package "
"naming/trust rules."

msgid ""
"**主仓完整门禁未通过：** 本次 ``make O=out/xorg-vmware-debug PROFILE=debug -j4 test`` 在 ``test-apk-"
"ownership.sh`` 停止，错误为 ``component policy mismatch: ['soundctl']``。后续未执行项不计为通过；本次未改变该组件策略。"
msgstr ""
"**Full repository gate failed:** this run of ``make O=out/xorg-vmware-debug PROFILE=debug -j4 "
"test`` stopped at ``test-apk-ownership.sh`` with ``component policy mismatch: ['soundctl']``. "
"Later unrun checks are not passes; component policy was not changed."

msgid ""
"**打包：** 本次为源码发布，未重新打包最终 5.1.1 系统镜像、ISO、Installer ISO 或 SDK。区间内各应用已有编译、镜像成员核对记录，不能将旧产物重标为本版二进制。"
msgstr ""
"**Packaging:** this source release did not repackage final 5.1.1 system images, ISO, Installer "
"ISO, or SDK. Applications have compilation/image-member records within the range; old artifacts "
"must not be relabeled as this release's binaries."

msgid ""
"**QEMU：** 区间内 Math++、Todo 等专题记录覆盖各自有限的操作、导出和磁盘结果检查；最近六个主窗口的“文件”标签检查使用基线私有副本注入新程序，Math 关窗退出 "
"139。本次没有对最终 5.1.1 标签进行整版 QEMU 验收；Mail 写信窗口本轮标签修改仅做源码/编译检查。"
msgstr ""
"**QEMU:** Math++, Todo, and other topic-specific records cover limited operations, exports, and "
"disk-result checks. The latest File-label check for six main windows injected new programs into "
"private baseline copies; closing Math exited 139. No full-release QEMU acceptance was run on the "
"final 5.1.1 tag; this round's Mail composition-label changes had only source/compilation checks."

msgid ""
"**VMware：VMware 验证未完成。** `SVGA3D 文档 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/SVGA3D.md>`__ 中原生 VMware "
"图形/性能及软件回退证据属于各自冻结源码和有限场景，不是本次整版验收，也不证明所有负载均加速。"
msgstr ""
"**VMware: validation is incomplete.** Native VMware graphics/performance and software-fallback "
"evidence in the `SVGA3D documentation "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/SVGA3D.md>`__ applies to its frozen "
"sources and limited scenarios, not full-release acceptance or proof of acceleration for every "
"workload."

msgid ""
"**真实硬件：** 本版未验证。内核侧测试与 ABI 门禁限制另见 `ReliefNT 5.1.1 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/releases/tag/v5.1.1>`__。"
msgstr ""
"**Physical hardware:** unverified for this release. For kernel tests and ABI gate limitations, see"
" `ReliefNT 5.1.1 <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/releases/tag/v5.1.1>`__."

